        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This exceptional home offers a modern open plan kitchen living dining space spanning the entire ground floor, extended and refurbished in 2021 and planned with real world ergonomics at its core. The layout prioritises easy movement, natural light and well defined zones, with all utilities neatly tucked away yet easily accessible to maintain clean lines and a calm, uncluttered aesthetic. Large sliding doors open onto a private, enclosed patio that is not overlooked, flowing directly to a dedicated entertainment outbuilding complete with bar, games area and WC, a superb year round social space.\n\nThe same thoughtful design continues throughout the property. There are four well proportioned bedrooms, each with ample built in storage, and three beautifully finished bathrooms designed for everyday practicality. The attic has been converted into an additional lounge and entertainment area, maintaining the same emphasis on comfort, flow and intelligent use of space that defines the ground floor.\n\nExternally, the property is designed for low maintenance living. A tarmac driveway to the front provides clean, durable parking, while the rear garden features cobble lock paving and artificial grass for an attractive, easy care finish. The current owners have placed particular focus on ambient lighting throughout the home, creating a warm, inviting atmosphere both inside and out.\n\nLocated in the heart of Duleek, the property enjoys immediate access to a wide range of village amenities including shops, cafés, primary schools, sports clubs, playgrounds and public transport links. Drogheda, the M1 motorway and major employment hubs are only minutes away, making this an ideal location for families, commuters and anyone seeking convenience without compromising on modern living standards.\n\nA must see property.\n\nFeatures\nBuilt 2005\nExtended and refurbished 2021\nCCTV\nLarge insulated outbuilding\nOpen plan family orientated family living\nLow maintenance exteriors\nSpacious and well proportioned property\nExcellent condition throughout\nHigh quality decor\nDouble glazed windows and triple glazed patio door\nTown centre Location\nEasy access to the M1 Dublin /Belfast corridor and the N2 Dublin/Derry corridor\nWalking Distance to all typical amenities\n\nACCOMMODATION\n\nEntrance Hall\nHigh quality laminate flooring, radiator cover, composite front door\nSitting Room\nHigh quality laminate flooring, Bay window, media wall, storage, ambient lighting, wall panelling\n\nKitchen/Dining\nHigh quality laminate flooring, Fitted kitchen units, oven, integrated over, hob & hood, quartz worktops and splashback, kitchen island, pellet stove, panelling, media wall and storage, sliding patio doors (triple glazing) onto rear patio\nUtility\nHigh quality laminate flooring, plumbed for washing machine and tumble dryer, built in storage\nDownstairs WC\nTiled flooring, WHB and vanity unit, toilet, panelling\nMain bathroom\nTiled throughout, bath, toilet, WHB\n\n\nBedroom 1\nCarpet flooring, panelling, sliderobes, ensuite\nEnsuite\nTiled throughout, pump shower, toilet, WHB and vanity unit\nBedroom 2\nCarpet flooring, built in storage\nBedroom 3\nCarpet flooring, built in storage\nBedroom 4\nCarpet flooring, built in storage\nBedroom 4\nCarpet flooring, built in storage\n\nAttic conversion\nCarpet flooring, TV point, velux windows, built in storage\n\nBar/Games Room\nCobble lock approach, sliding patio door, purpose built bar, high quality laminate flooring, wc, ambient lighting, TV point x 2\n\nOutside\nTarmac approach, off street parking for 2 cars, secure fencing, wide entrance gates, cobblelockpatio to rear, artificial grass, CCTV, outside tap, outside sockets\n\nConstruction\nThe property is of a Traditional Concrete build type with a tiled pitch roof, uPVC windows, composite door, The outer leaf is of a red brick and render finish. PVC fascia, soffit, gutters and downpipes.\n\nEssential services\nMains water\nMains sewage\nZoned GFCH\nOff street parking\nAlarmed\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only\n\nNegotiator\nAnthony Byrne\nAssocSCSI/AssocRICS\nH.Cert. Property Studies\nN.Dip. Building Surveying\nlicense no. 003939-007400"
